Sizing max_wal_size from measurement rather than guesswork.** During peak hours:

```
-- Run once and note the result.
SELECT pg_current_wal_lsn();
-- Wait checkpoint_timeout seconds, then run again.
SELECT pg_current_wal_lsn();
-- Compute WAL generated over that interval, in GB.
SELECT round(
pg_wal_lsn_diff('<second_lsn>', '<first_lsn>') / 1024.0 / 1024.0 / 1024.0,
2
) AS wal_generated_gb;
